{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>The curtain.</b> It is a term for a partition, and in the language of the Sages פַּרְגּוֹד is a thing that separates between the king and the people." "<b>Tekhelet and argaman.</b> Each and every kind was spun into each and every thread — six threads." "<b>The work of a weaver.</b> I have already explained that this is weaving of two walls, and the figures on its two sides are not alike." "<b>Cherubim.</b> Figures of creatures he shall make on it."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:49.466470725Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}